# env files — never committed
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env*.production

# supabase CLI state — per checkout, never shared
# `.temp/` holds the CLI's own bookkeeping (the `pgdelta` catalog hashes are a
# fingerprint of the local container), `.branches/` remembers which branch
# `supabase start` is on, and `snippets/` is Studio's saved queries. All three
# are the machine's, not the project's: `docs/deploy.md` §1 already tells every
# checkout to link its own project into `.temp/`.
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/
supabase/snippets/

